This repository adds a separate Swift/SwiftUI implementation, native storage and
engines, offline web integrations, test harnesses and dependency preparation
scripts. It does not contain the upstream Linux/server application.

Original native source contributed to this project is licensed under Apache-2.0.
Retained third-party source, fonts, icons and generated dependencies are governed
by their own licenses; see docs/LICENSING.md, ipad/DEPENDENCIES.md,
ipad/WEB_TOOLS.md and the notices adjacent to each retained upstream file.
The compiled app must not be described as Apache-only.

Public-source packaging changes include standalone documentation, a generated
unsigned Xcode project with an independent default bundle identifier, and
exclusion of private device reports, downloaded content and build products.

Project NOMAD and third-party names are used to describe provenance and
compatibility. No trademark rights or endorsement are granted or implied.
